WEBVTT

00:04:55.249 --> 00:05:00.254
all the numerous factors
that impact actual emissions,

00:05:00.254 --> 00:05:04.383
so it’s hard to set targets
and action plans.

00:05:04.884 --> 00:05:09.096
This is where the sustainability team
calls data scientists

00:05:09.096 --> 00:05:15.061
to come in and process detailed data
about the type of glass,

00:05:15.061 --> 00:05:16.771
the color of the glass,

00:05:16.771 --> 00:05:18.189
the recycling share,

00:05:18.189 --> 00:05:20.441
the supplier country of origin,

00:05:20.441 --> 00:05:21.984
the transportation mode,

00:05:21.984 --> 00:05:22.985
by brand,

00:05:22.985 --> 00:05:23.986
by product.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:28.240
They can simulate the design
and the supply chain

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:30.117
and integrate in the calculation